'''IndicBooks''' is the structured-data catalogue for books digitised with the Indic Book Metadata Extractor. Each reviewed book is published as a Wikibase item with statements for author, publisher, language, ISBN and 40+ other fields.

== Browse the catalogue ==
* [{{fullurl:Special:AllPages|namespace=120}} All items]
* [{{fullurl:Special:Search|search=haswbstatement:P2=Q1&ns120=1}} All books] — every item with instance of (P2) = Q1; extend with `haswbstatement:P3=…` for authors or `P6=…` for publishers
* [{{fullurl:Special:AllPages|namespace=122}} All properties]
* [[Special:RecentChanges|Recent changes]]
* [[Special:Search|Search]]

== How the data is produced ==
# Upload and OCR the book in the Indic Book Metadata Extractor.
# Review the extracted metadata.
# Export as OpenRefine CSV, then clean and reconcile in OpenRefine.
# Publish with the Wikibase extension or the backend publish endpoint.

